Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:33.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,《冰雪奇缘》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冰天雪地风儿吹 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Born of cold and winter air ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:02:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 山中雨水凝起 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And mountain rain combining ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冰雪的威力美又邪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ This icy force both foul and fair ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 晶莹的心值得采集 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Has a frozen heart worth mining ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 坚冰凿开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So out through the heart ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 清又冽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Cold and clear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢爱不怕未来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Strike for love and strike for fear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 美丽清晰在眼前 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ See the beauty sharp and sheer ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 劈开冰儿哟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Split the ice apart ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 叩开冻结的心 嘿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And break the frozen heart Hup, ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小心点 开始吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Watch your step Let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 嘿 哟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Hup, ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小心点 开始吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Watch your step Let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 美丽 霸气 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Beautiful Powerful ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 危险 冻人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Dangerous Cold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冰霜的魔力神秘绝伦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Ice has a magic Can't be controlled ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一人抵不过 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Stronger than one ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 十人抵不过 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Stronger than ten ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一百人也得摇头叹！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Stronger than a hundred men! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Oh! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冰天雪地风儿吹 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Born of cold And winter air ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 山中雨水凝起 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And mountain rain combining ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冰雪的威力美又邪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ This icy force both foul and fair ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 晶莹的心值得采集 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Has a frozen heart worth mining ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 坚冰凿开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Cut through the heart ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 清又冽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Cold and clear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢爱不怕未来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Strike for love and strike for fear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 美丽与危机都存在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's beauty and there's danger here ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 劈开冰儿哟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Split the ice apart ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小心冻结的心 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Beware the frozen heart ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟上 斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa. Psst!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快起来 快起来 快起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wake up. Wake up. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮了 我也醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The sky is awake, so I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, we have to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟自己玩去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go play by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想堆个雪人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you want to build a snowman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 来嘛 来嘛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快用魔法！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do the magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快用魔法嘛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do the magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Ready? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,太赞了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi, I'm Olaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢暖暖的拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I like warm hugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 雪宝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love you, Olaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Tickle bumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢嚯！- 慢点儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Whoo-hoo! - Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mama! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 安娜 我接住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're okay, Anna. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 你都干了些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa, what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的能力失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is getting out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个意外 对不起 安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was an accident. I'm sorry, Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 她身体冷冰冰的 - 我知道该去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh. She's ice cold. - I know where we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Faster, Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帮帮忙！我女儿出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please! Help! It's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是国王来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 石精？- 嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Trolls? - Shush!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在偷听呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm trying to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱 我就留下你们好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cuties. I'm going to keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这魔力是天生的 还是受了诅咒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Born with the powers, or cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天生的 而且越来越强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Born. And they're getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很幸运 被击中的不是心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You are lucky it wasn't her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏的转变难以扭转\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The heart is not so easily changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但脑袋或许可以改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But the head can be persuaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你觉得该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do what you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为确保安全 我建议移除\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I recommend we remove all magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有与魔法有关的东西 甚至记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Even memories of magic, to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不用担心 我会把开心留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But don't worry. I'll leave the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她会忘记我有魔法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But she won't remember I have powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 埃尔莎 你的魔力只会与日俱增\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Listen to me, Elsa. Your power will only grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很美丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There is beauty in it…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but also great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须学着控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You must learn to control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧将与你为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fear will be your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We'll protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定能学会控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She can learn to control it. I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Until then…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将锁起大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}we'll lock the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,裁减侍卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We'll reduce the staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将限制她和别人接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We will limit her contact with people,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让任何人知道她的魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and keep her powers hidden from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Including Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你想不想堆个雪人？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Do you wanna build a snowman? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 我们去玩耍 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Come on, let's go and play ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我再没见过你出来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I never see you anymore ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 门快打开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Come out the door ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我怕你真的会离开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It's like you've gone away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们曾是好姐妹 现在却不理不睬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We used to be best buddies and now we're not ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 多希望你能讲明白 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I wish you would tell me why ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你想不想堆个雪人？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Do you wanna build a snowman? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 想玩什么都可以呀 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It doesn't have to be a snowman ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走开 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go away, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 好啦 拜 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Okay, bye ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,手套能帮你忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The gloves will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧？藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}See? Conceal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让它显露\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't let it show.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你想不想堆个雪人？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Do you wanna build a snowman? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或是骑车兜个风？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Or ride our bike around the halls? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 真的好想有人陪我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I think some company is overdue ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只能朝画像说话让我好难过 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I've started talking to the pictures on the walls ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 贞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang in there, Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 空空荡荡的房间 好寂寞 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It gets a little lonely all these empty rooms ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只有钟摆滴答走 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Just watching the hours tick by ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它越来越强了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,沮丧只会让它变得更糟 平静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Getting upset only makes it worse. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！别碰我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No! Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我不想伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please, I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,两星期后见！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}See you in two weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:09:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们非得走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 埃尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You'll be fine, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拜托 我知道你在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Please I know you're in there ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别人都纷纷问起你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ People are asking where you've been ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我在努力变得更勇敢 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ They say "Have courage" And I'm trying to ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 给你力量与陪伴 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm right out here for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把门打开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Just let me in ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们只剩下彼此 欢笑不再 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We only have each other It's just you and me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 怎么面对未来？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ What are we gonna do? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想堆个雪人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you wanna build a snowman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:43.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（三年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体上岸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All ashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到艾伦戴尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Welcome to Arendelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意脚下安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Watch your step, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门很快就会打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The gates will be opening soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为啥要穿这个呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why do I have to wear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为女王成年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because the queen has come of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是加冕日！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's Coronation Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么 斯文？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What do you want, Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「给我点零食」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Give me a snack."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,得说什么来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's the magic word?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「请」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Please."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶！不对 要分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh! Uh-uh-uh. Share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直不敢相信 她们终于把门打开了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't believe they're finally opening up the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且是一整天！- 快点 珀西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- And for a whole day! - Faster, Percy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔 我们那神秘的交易伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle, our most mysterious trade partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,敞开大门 让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Open those gates so I may unlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖出你的秘密 榨干你的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}your secrets and exploit your riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是说出来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did I say that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！我等不及想见见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh! Me sore eyes can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王和公主的容貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to see the queen and the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说一定非常可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I bet they are absolutely lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说肯定美极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I bet they are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜公主？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Princess Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜公主？- 呃？什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Princess Anna? - Huh? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉吵醒你 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Sorry to wake you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:12:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 你没吵醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no, no, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've been up for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Still me, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门即将打开 该梳洗准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The gates will open soon. Time to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ready for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,您姐姐的加冕日 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your sister's coronation, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐的加冕日\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My sister's corneration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是加冕日！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's Coronation Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是加冕日！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's Coronation Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打开窗子！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The window is open! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 推开门！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So's that door! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我从不知道他们会这么做 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I didn't know they did that anymore ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 连沙拉盘子都有八千个！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who knew we owned 8, 000 salad plates? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无人的走廊常走过 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ For years I've roamed these empty halls ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 闲置的舞厅好寂寞 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Why have a ballroom with no balls? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今日大门终将会敞开！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Finally they're opening up the gates! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 人群拥挤 触手可及 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There'll be actual, real, live people ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 好像有点不适应 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It'll be totally strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可我早已准备迎接新世界！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But wow! Am I so ready for this change! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为第一次在生命里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause for the first time in forever ∮
