Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不要啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下 请摘下您的手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty, the gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔女王埃尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen Elsa of Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔女王埃尔莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen Elsa of Arendelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请艾伦戴尔女王埃尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen Elsa of Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请艾伦戴尔公主安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Princess Anna of Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这里吗？你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Here? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我觉得我不应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because I don't think I'm supposed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说「嗨」吗？哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Hi" me? Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Um… Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你也「满」漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you. You look beautiful-ler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不是「满」 你看起来才不胖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, not "fuller." You don't look fuller.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是比我更美\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is what a party looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象的要暖和点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's warmer than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么味道这么好闻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is that amazing smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是黄鼠狼镇公爵 - 是「威尔镇」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- The Duke of Weaseltown. - "Weselton"!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下 我是威尔镇公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Duke of Weselton, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为贵国最紧密的贸易伙伴 由我邀请您跳加冕以来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}As your closest partner in trade it seems only fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一支舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that I offer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是再合适不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}your first dance as queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}One-two, and jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您 不过 我不跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you. Only, I don't dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.92,0:21:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我妹妹会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But my sister does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 哦！你真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What? - Oh! Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, I don't think…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你要晕倒了就告诉我 我会拉住你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If you swoon, let me know. I'll catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,像孔雀一样轻盈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like an agile peacock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ow! Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 打开城堡的大门真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Speaking of, so great to have the gates open.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们之前为什么要关上门啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why did they shut them in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是怎么回事吗？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you know the reason? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right. Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可不是无缘无故就叫我「小北斗星」的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They don't call me the "Little Dipper" for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,像猴子一样灵巧 我可要飞起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like a chicken with the face of a monkey, I fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 准备好再来一次的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me know when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要告诉我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}for another round, Milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.92,0:22:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的很有活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, he was sprightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是他还穿着高跟鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Especially for a man in heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没比现在更好过 这样太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've never been better. This is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望可以一直这样下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wish it could be like this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.52,0:22:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 就是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Why not? - It just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Excuse me for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到非常荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'd be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴我拉住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Glad I caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.00,0:22:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 汉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常情况下我可以在整个大厅里滑来滑去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I often had a whole parlor to myself to slide!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:22:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！- 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh! - Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.72,0:23:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说 你的长相也很不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your physique helps, I'm sure, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头发是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.48,0:23:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我生来就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh, I was born with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然在梦里 我被石精亲过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Although, I dreamed I was kissed by a troll.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.48,0:23:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 等下 等下 你有多少个兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, wait, wait. So, you have how many brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有十二个哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Twelve older brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中的三个一直当我不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Three of them pretended I was invisible,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.48,0:23:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 差不多有两年都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}literally, for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥们就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's what brothers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐们也是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎和我小时候亲密无间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa and I were really close when we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来 有一天 她就开始不理我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But then, one day, she just shut me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I never knew why.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会把你拒之门外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I would never shut you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.64,0:23:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我能说点疯狂的话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, can I just say something crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.44,0:23:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢疯狂一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.08,0:23:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的生活一直不能尽如人意 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ All my life has been A series of doors in my face ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到今天邂逅了你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And then suddenly I bump into you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的 因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was thinking the same thing, because, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.96,0:24:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我一直都在寻找 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I've been searching my whole life ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 属于自己的位置 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ To find my own place ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可能是派对让人疯狂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And maybe it's the party talking ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.88,0:24:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或许是巧克力太过甜蜜 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Or the chocolate fondue ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.04,0:24:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但是和你在一起 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But with you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.08,0:24:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 和你在一起 我找到了归处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But with you I found my place ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的眼中只有你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I see your face ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.04,0:24:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这种感觉 美妙新奇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And it's nothing like I've ever known before ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.04,0:24:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱情之门 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Love is an open ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 终于敞开！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Door! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱情之门 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Love is an open ∮
