Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.76,0:25:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请让一下 - 不好意思 哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Coming through. - Excuse me. Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.96,0:25:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 借过 - 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Pardon. Sorry. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一下好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can we just get around you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.64,0:25:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 哦！她在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you. Oh! There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.56,0:25:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
