Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我向您介绍南艾尔的汉斯王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}May I present Prince Hans of the Southern Isles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty.
