Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.48,0:26:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 婚姻？- 是！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Marriage? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我没太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我们也没太明白呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, we haven't worked out all the details ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.16,0:26:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得花几天计划一下婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We'll need a few days to plan the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.08,0:26:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过宴会上肯定会有浓汤 牛排和冰激凌 而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Of course, we'll have soup, roast and ice cream. And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你可以住在这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. Would we live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.00,0:26:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里？- 当然可以！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Here? - Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.00,0:26:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安娜！- 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Anna! - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以邀请你的十二个哥哥都来和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We can invite all 12 of your brothers to stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.68,0:26:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What? No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.96,0:26:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们这里当然住得下 - 等下 慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Of course we have the room. - Wait, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.64,0:26:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的哥哥们不能住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No one's brothers are staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.32,0:26:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也不能结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No one is getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.16,0:26:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.52,0:26:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跟你单独谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}May I talk to you, please? Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.04,0:26:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 你要说什么都可以和我们俩说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. Whatever you have to say, you can say to both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.40,0:26:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你不能嫁给一个刚刚认识的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fine. You can't marry a man you just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.36,0:26:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是真爱就没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can if it's true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.24,0:26:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 你知道什么是真爱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, what do you know about true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道的比你多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}More than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.36,0:26:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只知道怎么拒人于千里外\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All you know is how to shut people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我祝福你们 但是我不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You asked for my blessing, but my answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.48,0:26:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下 如果我能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty, if I may ease your…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.44,0:26:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 而且我认为你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, you may not. And I think you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.28,0:27:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对结束了 关上城门\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The party is over. Close the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.81,0:27:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 陛下 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yes, Your Majesty. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 别这样 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa, no, no! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手套还给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Give me my glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.96,0:27:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 求你了 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.72,0:27:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再过这样的日子了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't live like this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.28,0:27:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Then leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What did I ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Enough, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.92,0:27:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要说 为什么？你为什么不理我了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, why? Why do you shut me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.24,0:27:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么把整个世界都拒之门外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why do you shut the world out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.92,0:27:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在害怕什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.84,0:27:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你别说了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I said, enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.56,0:27:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道这里很可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I knew there was something dubious going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！就是她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes! It is her!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:27:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.68,0:28:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们美丽的女王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Our beautiful queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.60,0:28:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下？您还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.76,0:28:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那！拦住她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There she is! Stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.28,0:28:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 请离我远一点 离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please, just stay away from me. Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.76,0:28:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物 怪物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Monster. Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.68,0:28:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.12,0:28:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.00,0:29:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.64,0:29:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.00,0:29:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这个海峡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The fjord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下雪了！- 下雪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Snow! - Snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.08,0:29:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 下雪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Are you all right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.24,0:29:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.20,0:29:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 下雪了 下雪了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, it's snowing. It's snowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王诅咒了整片大陆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The queen has cursed this land!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.56,0:29:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人去阻止她！你快去追她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She must be stopped! You have to go after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.80,0:29:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.20,0:29:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你！你也会魔法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You! Is there sorcery in you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是怪物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you a monster, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我就是个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no. I'm completely ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.36,0:29:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我可以保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's right, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:29:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是好的那种普通\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In the best way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.60,0:30:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我姐姐也不是什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And my sister is not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.16,0:30:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她差点杀死我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She nearly killed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.80,0:30:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在冰上滑倒了而已 - 那也是她弄出来的冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You slipped on ice. - Her ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.40,0:30:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个意外 她被吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was an accident. She was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.04,0:30:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是故意的 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She didn't mean it. She didn't mean any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.20,0:30:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚是我的错 我不该逼她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Tonight was my fault. I pushed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, I'm the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.04,0:30:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去把她找回来 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- that needs to go after her. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.32,0:30:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把我的马牵来 谢谢 - 安娜 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Bring me my horse, please. - Anna, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.72,0:30:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.28,0:30:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎才不危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa is not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.40,0:30:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带她回来 我会处理好一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll bring her back, and I'll make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.28,0:30:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.36,0:30:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我需要你帮我管理艾伦戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I need you here to take care of Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}On my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.88,0:30:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我授予汉斯王子管理艾伦戴尔的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I leave Prince Hans in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.40,0:30:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定可以信任她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you sure you can trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.56,0:30:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想你受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't want you getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.44,0:30:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.20,0:30:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她永远不会伤害我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She would never hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今夜的山上 白雪闪亮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The snow glows white On the mountain tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.96,0:31:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 渺无人烟的地方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Not a footprint to be seen ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 孤独的国土 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ A kingdom of isolation ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.96,0:31:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 而我是这里的女王 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And it looks like I'm the queen ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.36,0:31:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 狂风正在呼啸 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The wind is howling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.56,0:31:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 犹如内心风暴 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like this swirling storm inside ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.44,0:31:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 已经无力隐瞒 上天知我苦心 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Couldn't keep it in Heaven knows I tried ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.44,0:31:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不要进来 别被看见 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Don't let them in Don't let them see ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 做个好女孩 像以前一样 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Be the good girl You always have to be ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.32,0:32:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 隐藏 别想 别被发现 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Conceal, don't feel Don't let them know ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.36,0:32:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他们却已知晓 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Well, now they know ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随它吧！随它吧！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let it go! Let it go! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.52,0:32:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如今不必再隐藏 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can't hold me back anymore ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随它吧！随它吧！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let it go! Let it go! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.36,0:32:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 关上门 转身离开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Turn away and slam the door ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.52,0:32:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不在乎 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I don't care ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.92,0:32:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别人说的话 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ What they're going to say ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.88,0:32:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 任狂风呼啸 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let the storm rage on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.96,0:32:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 严寒再不能令我害怕 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The cold never bothered me anyway ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.20,0:32:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从前遥不可及 如今触手可得 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It's funny how some distance Makes everything seem small ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.72,0:32:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 过去的恐惧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And the fears that once controlled me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再也不会烦扰我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can't get to me at all ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.56,0:32:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大展身手的时候已经来到 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It's time to see what I can do ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.96,0:33:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打破极限 尽情创造 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ To test the limits and break through ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.52,0:33:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有对错 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ No right, no wrong ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.04,0:33:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有规则 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ No rules for me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.68,0:33:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我自由了！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm free! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.08,0:33:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随它吧！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let it go! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.76,0:33:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随它吧！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let it go! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.64,0:33:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我可以迎风飞扬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I am one with the wind and sky ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随它吧！随它吧！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let it go! Let it go! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.84,0:33:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再不会见我哭泣 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You'll never see me cry ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.84,0:33:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这里是 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Here I stand ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.28,0:33:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的归宿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And here I'll stay ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.20,0:33:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 任狂风呼啸 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let the storm rage on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.08,0:33:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的雪花 冲向云霄 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ My power flurries through the air ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.04,0:33:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 布满大地 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the ground ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的灵魂 盘旋涌动 映入万千雪花 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ My soul is spiraling in frozen fractals all around ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.84,0:34:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 心绪所致 冰晶绽放 宛若晶莹冰花 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And one thought crystallizes Like an icy blast ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.88,0:34:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我再也不会回头 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm never going back ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 过往已无可留恋 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The past is in the past ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.56,0:34:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 挣开吧！那锁链！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let it go! Let it go! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.12,0:34:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我要升华如黎明曙光 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And I'll rise like the break of dawn ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.60,0:34:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随它吧！随它吧！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let it go! Let it go! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.36,0:34:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那完美的女孩已经不再 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ That perfect girl is gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.20,0:34:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这是全新的我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Here I stand ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.76,0:34:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在朝阳之中 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ In the light of day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.48,0:34:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 任狂风呼啸！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let the storm rage on! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.36,0:34:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 严寒再不能令我害怕 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The cold never bothered me anyway ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.04,0:34:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.76,0:34:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！是我啊 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa, it's me, Anna,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.68,0:35:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你把夏天冻成冬天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}your sister who didn't mean to make you freeze the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.92,0:35:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry. It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.45,0:35:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 她要是早告诉我她的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Of course, none of it would have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.08,0:35:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不至于这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}if she had just told me her secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.68,0:35:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好烦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's a stinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.68,0:35:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.44,0:35:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 别别别！回来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no. No, no, no! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.88,0:35:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.04,0:35:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.04,0:35:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪 就非得是雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Snow. It had to be snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就不能使热点的魔法嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She couldn't have had tropical magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.44,0:35:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给峡湾盖上白沙还有 暖洋洋的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that covered the fjords in white sand and warm…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.64,0:35:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.88,0:35:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷 冷 冷 冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cold, cold, cold, cold, cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.88,0:36:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪橡树交易站\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wandering Oaken's Trading Post.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.92,0:36:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 还有桑拿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ooh."And sauna"!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.08,0:36:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哟呼 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yoo-hoo. - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏季清仓大甩卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Big summer blowout.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.28,0:36:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,泳装 木屐半价出售\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Half off swimming suits, clogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.60,0:36:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我自制的防晒霜 如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and a sun balm of my own invention, yah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.32,0:36:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好极了 先给我来双靴子吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Great. For now, um, how about boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.44,0:36:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,冬装和靴子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Winter boots and dresses?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.76,0:36:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在我们的冬季专柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That would be in our winter department.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.60,0:36:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.44,0:36:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇的问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.80,0:36:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有其他年轻女子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Has another young woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.08,0:36:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说女王啦 我也说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}the queen perhaps, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.72,0:36:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}passed through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.96,0:36:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雪天还头脑发热跑出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The only one crazy enough to be out in this storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.44,0:36:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你哦 小妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}is you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.08,0:36:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和这位小哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You and this fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.48,0:36:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yoo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.52,0:37:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏季清仓大甩卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Big summer blowout.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.64,0:37:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡萝卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Carrots.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.00,0:37:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.64,0:37:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！是啊 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh! Right. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.64,0:37:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面真的是七月飘雪 是不是啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. A real howler in July, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.44,0:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪是从哪里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wherever could it be coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.00,0:37:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从北峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The North Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.08,0:37:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,北峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}North Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.76,0:37:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总共40块\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That will be 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.12,0:37:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,40块？太贵 10块\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Forty? No, 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.88,0:37:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 小哥 不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, dear, that's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.16,0:37:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们冬季的藏货\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}See, this is from our winter stock,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.16,0:37:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在供给和需求是很成问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}where supply and demand have a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.16,0:37:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要跟我扯供需关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You want to talk about a supply and demand problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.48,0:37:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠卖冰吃饭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I sell ice for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.08,0:37:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那生意现在可不好做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ooh. That's a rough business to be in right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.00,0:37:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, that is really…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.36,0:37:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.84,0:37:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,40块 不二价\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Still 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过赠送免费橡木桑拿一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I will throw in a visit to Oaken's sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟呼 嗨 亲们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yoo-hoo. Hi, family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.68,0:37:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟呼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.32,0:37:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有10块 帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ten is all I got. Help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.20,0:37:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 10块只够买这个 别的不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. Ten will get you this and no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.84,0:37:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就问你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, just tell me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.08,0:37:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,北峰上出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What was happening on the North Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.04,0:37:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是像施了法术？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did it seem magical?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.96,0:38:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.20,0:38:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在给我站开点 我先搞定这个奸商\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, back up while I deal with this crook, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.04,0:38:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫人家什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.72,0:38:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 行啦 我出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, okay. I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.72,0:38:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.80,0:38:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.84,0:38:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 斯文 我没有买到胡萝卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, Sven, I didn't get your carrots.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.56,0:38:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我找到休息的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I did find us a place to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.80,0:38:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还免费哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And it's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.88,0:38:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 下手重了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry about this violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.56,0:38:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,再送你一品脱碱鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I will add a quart of lutefisk,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.56,0:38:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家还是好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so we have good feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.24,0:38:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要外套和靴子 还有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just the outfit and the boots, yah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.08,0:38:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.76,0:38:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 驯鹿比人友善 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Reindeers are better than people ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.56,0:38:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 斯文 你是不是也这样看？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sven, don't you think that's true? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.04,0:38:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 「没错 人会打你 骂你 还会骗你」 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ "Yeah, people will beat you And curse you and cheat you" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.24,0:38:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 「他们都是坏蛋 除了你」 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ "Every one of them's bad, except you"∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.92,0:39:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哇 谢谢啦 哥们 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Aw. Thanks, buddy. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但没有驯鹿的气味 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But people smell better than reindeers ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 斯文 是不是这样？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sven, don't you think I'm right? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.44,0:39:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 「你又对了 他们都没气味 但你有」 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ "That's once again true For all, except you" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.44,0:39:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 说得好 真是精彩的一晚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You got me Let's call it a night ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.48,0:39:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 「晚安」 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ "Good night" ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.92,0:39:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小心别被 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Don't let the frostbite ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.16,0:39:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冻伤 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Bite ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.28,0:39:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,合唱真动听\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nice duet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.12,0:39:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊 你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's just you. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.28,0:39:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你载我上北峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I want you to take me up the North Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.64,0:39:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不拉人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't take people places.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.16,0:39:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me rephrase that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.76,0:39:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我上北峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take me up the North Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.20,0:39:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.08,0:39:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道怎么让这寒冷天气结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, I know how to stop this winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.48,0:39:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We leave at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.64,0:39:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了买斯文的胡萝卜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you forgot the carrots for Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.72,0:40:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.00,0:40:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 抱歉 我不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.72,0:40:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就走 立刻马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We leave now. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.16,0:40:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.24,0:40:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓牢了！我们喜欢开块\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on! We like to go fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.40,0:40:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢快 - 哇！哇 哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I like fast. - Whoa! Whoa, whoa, whoa…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.92,0:40:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把脚放下 这刚上过漆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get your feet down. This is fresh lacquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.64,0:40:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 你不是乡下长大的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Seriously, were you raised in a barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.24,0:40:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.68,0:40:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才不是 我在城堡里长大的 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No, I was raised in a castle. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.84,0:40:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, uh, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.52,0:40:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王怎么了 为什么乱下雪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what made the queen go all ice-crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.68,0:40:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.20,0:40:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.76,0:40:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我定了婚 她就抓狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I got engaged, but then she freaked out,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.12,0:40:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我才那天刚认识那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}because I'd only just met him, you know, that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.12,0:40:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她说她不会祝福我们的婚姻 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And she said she wouldn't bless the marriage, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你和刚认识的人订婚了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. You got engaged to someone you just met that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.44,0:40:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啦 反正就是我生气了 她也生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. Anyway, I got mad, and so she got mad,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.76,0:40:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她就想走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and then she tried to walk away,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.81,0:40:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就抓住她的手套…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I grabbed her glove…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.88,0:40:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.04,0:40:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你跟个那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You mean to tell me you got engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.00,0:41:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚认识的人订婚了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to someone you just met that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.68,0:41:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你专心点听好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes. Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.16,0:41:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是说起来 她老是带着手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But the thing is, she wore the gloves all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.20,0:41:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想 她可能是有洁癖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so I just thought, maybe she has a thing about dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.64,0:41:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母没告诉你要小心陌生人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Didn't your parents ever warn you about strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.24,0:41:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他们说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.52,0:41:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但汉斯王子不是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But Hans is not a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真的？他姓什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, yeah? What's his last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.96,0:41:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「来自南艾尔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Of the Southern Isles."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.56,0:41:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他最爱吃什么？- 三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What's his favorite food? - Sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.00,0:41:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最好的朋友叫什么？- 好像叫约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Best friend's name? - Probably John.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.40,0:41:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 眼睛什么颜色？- 梦幻色\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Eye color? - Dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.49,0:41:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脚多大？- 脚多大根本不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Foot size? - Foot size doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.08,0:41:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他吃过饭没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Have you had a meal with him yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你讨厌他的吃相怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What if you hate the way he eats?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.92,0:41:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他挖鼻孔的样子讨人嫌怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What if you hate the way he picks his nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.60,0:41:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖鼻孔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Picks his nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.88,0:41:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And eats it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.00,0:41:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 人家是王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Excuse me, sir. He is a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.40,0:41:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 男人都一样 - 恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- All men do it. - Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.60,0:41:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 那不重要 我们是真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, it doesn't matter. It's true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.49,0:41:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不像真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It doesn't sound like true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.80,0:41:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是什么爱情专家啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you some sort of love expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.08,0:41:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 但我有朋友是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. But, uh, I have friends who are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.92,0:41:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.24,0:41:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爱情专家？我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}who are love experts? I'm not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.64,0:41:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说话 - 不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Stop talking. - No, no, no. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.32,0:41:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我倒想见见这些… - 我说真的 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I'd like to meet these… - No, I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.96,0:42:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.16,0:42:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.96,0:42:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What are they? - Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.48,0:42:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.00,0:42:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么办？- 我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What do we do? - I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.48,0:42:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 别掉下去 也别被狼给吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You just… Don't fall off, and don't get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.76,0:42:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I want to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.80,0:42:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用 - 为什么不用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.92,0:42:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不相信你的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because I don't trust your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.28,0:42:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会和刚认识的男人结婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who marries a man she just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.12,0:42:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真爱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's true love!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.44,0:42:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.68,0:42:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.32,0:42:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯豆腐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Christopher!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.92,0:42:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫「克里斯多夫」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's "Kristoff"!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.32,0:42:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.96,0:42:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.32,0:42:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点烧着我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You almost set me on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.76,0:42:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有烧着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.36,0:42:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备跳 斯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get ready to jump, Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.76,0:42:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要指挥他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't tell him what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.28,0:43:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！- 我来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hey! - I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.76,0:43:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳 斯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Jump, Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.84,0:43:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好险！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.48,0:43:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚买的雪橇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I just paid it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.24,0:43:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh-oh. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.48,0:43:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.52,0:43:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊！天啊 天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ah! No, no, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.40,0:43:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Grab on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.92,0:43:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上拉 斯文 拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Pull, Sven. Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.52,0:43:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.20,0:43:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赔你雪橇的 还有上面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll replace your sled, and everything in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.44,0:43:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想帮我了 我也能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I understand if you don't want to help me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.72,0:43:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然是不想再帮她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Of course I don't want to help her anymore. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.72,0:43:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 出了这种事 我再也不想帮别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}this whole thing has ruined me for helping anyone ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.04,0:44:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是往这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.08,0:44:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「她自己一个人会挂掉的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"She'll die on her own."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.20,0:44:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不介意 - 我就往这儿啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I can live with that. - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.12,0:44:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,「她要是死了 雪橇就没人赔了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"But you won't get your new sled if she's dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.32,0:44:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 应该是往上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think, actually, it's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.97,0:44:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 我真的不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sometimes, I really don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.40,0:44:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hold up! We're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.36,0:44:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.40,0:44:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 好吧 我允许让你跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, sure. I'll let you tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.64,0:44:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.68,0:44:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全被雪覆盖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's completely frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.56,0:44:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 埃尔莎会把雪化掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But it will be fine. Elsa will thaw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.08,0:44:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Will she?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.44,0:44:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啦 现在赶路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.12,0:44:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,往北峰走这边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This way to the North Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.24,0:44:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}More like this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.56,0:45:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没发现 冬天的景色这么美\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I never knew winter could be so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.12,0:45:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.56,0:45:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It really is beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.16,0:45:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是白茫茫的一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But it's so white.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.76,0:45:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多点色彩会不会更美？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, how about a little color?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.64,0:45:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得加点深红色 嫩绿色不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm thinking maybe some crimson, chartreuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.00,0:45:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄色怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How about yellow?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.84,0:45:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 不能加黄色 黄色和白色？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, not yellow. Yellow and snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.00,0:45:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不搭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.08,0:45:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.08,0:45:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hi. - You're creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.24,0:45:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇！- 拿走啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Whoa! - I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.64,0:45:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿着 - 别把我的头弄掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Back at you. - Please don't drop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.08,0:45:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 别扔了 就是个头而已嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No. - Come on, it's just a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.36,0:45:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 初次见面不太顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right. We got off to a bad start.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.68,0:45:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊呀 不要 身体跑过来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ew, ew, ew, the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.08,0:45:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我现在看到的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, what am I looking at right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.80,0:46:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们都跟蝙蝠一样大头朝下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why are you hanging off the earth like a bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.52,0:46:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right, wait one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.00,0:46:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.56,0:46:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.76,0:46:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.36,0:46:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完整啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, I'm perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.76,0:46:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 还缺一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.20,0:46:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚就像我整个人生都颠倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was like my whole life got turned upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.24,0:46:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！对不起太用力了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh! Too hard. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.69,0:46:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 头好晕！- 我不小心… 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Head rush! - I was just… Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.36,0:46:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂止没有事？简直棒极了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you kidding me? I am wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.88,0:46:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想要个鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've always wanted a nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.81,0:46:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.12,0:46:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱 就像独角兽宝宝的角\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's like a little baby unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.88,0:46:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…嘿！哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But… Hey! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.00,0:46:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.04,0:46:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更好看啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love it even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.20,0:46:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我们重新认识一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right, let's start this thing over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.20,0:46:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.24,0:46:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.32,0:46:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢暖暖的拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I like warm hugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.08,0:46:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.48,0:46:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's right. Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.36,0:46:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.72,0:46:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.16,0:46:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.24,0:46:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边长得很奇怪的驴子叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And who's the funky-looking donkey over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.68,0:46:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它叫斯文 - 哦哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- That's Sven. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.24,0:46:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那麋鹿叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And who's the reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.20,0:46:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.24,0:47:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嗯 好吧 这样就简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, the… Oh. Okay. That makes things easier for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.08,0:47:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 看呐 他还想亲我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Aw, look at him trying to kiss my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.84,0:47:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伦家也喜欢你 - 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I like you, too. - Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.24,0:47:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是埃尔莎创造了你吗？- 是啊 问这干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Did Elsa build you? - Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.64,0:47:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.76,0:47:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真不错 - 知道 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Fascinating. - Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能带我们去找她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you think you could show us the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.48,0:47:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,能 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.76,0:47:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How does this work? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.12,0:47:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动 斯文 好好听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop it, Sven. I'm trying to focus, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.36,0:47:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 我来告诉你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yeah. Why? - I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.92,0:47:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让埃尔莎把夏天变回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We need Elsa to bring back summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.96,0:47:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏天？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Summer? - Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.52,0:47:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.84,0:47:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是对夏天心驰神往\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but I've always loved the idea of summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.60,0:47:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大太阳 火力四射\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And sun, and all things hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.20,0:47:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.28,0:47:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我以为你没经历过热天气呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm guessing you don't have much experience with heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.84,0:47:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实没\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.28,0:47:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时候 我喜欢闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But sometimes I like to close my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.76,0:47:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象着自己置身于盛夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and imagine what it would be like when summer does come.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.68,0:47:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 蜜蜂飞舞 孩子们吹着蒲公英 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Bees will buzz. Kids will blow dandelion fuzz. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.12,0:47:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 而我也在过着夏天 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And I'll be doing whatever snow does in summer. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.48,0:47:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 手拿冷饮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ A drink in my hand. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.84,0:48:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 躺在沙滩上晒太阳 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ My snow up against the burning sand. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.24,0:48:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也许会晒成性感的古铜色 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Probably getting gorgeously tanned ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.52,0:48:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在夏天 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ in summer. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.64,0:48:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我终于要见到 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'll finally see a summer breeze ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.88,0:48:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 夏日的风吹散冬日的烦恼 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ blow away a winter storm. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.00,0:48:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 气温渐渐变暖 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And find out what happens to solid water ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.28,0:48:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小河水也都解冻了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ when it gets warm. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.92,0:48:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我迫不及待地 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And I can't wait to see ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.00,0:48:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 想看到小伙伴们的反应 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ what my buddies all think of me. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.32,0:48:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 想象一下我会变得多么灿烂 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Just imagine how much cooler I'll be ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.80,0:48:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在夏天！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ in summer! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.60,0:48:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 炽热和冷冽 多么强烈∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The hot and the cold are both so intense. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.68,0:48:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 交织在一起 多么般配 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Put them together. It just makes sense. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.44,0:48:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 冬天是休养生息的好时节 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Winter's a good time to stay in and cuddle. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.68,0:48:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但如果到了夏天 我会变成一个… ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But put me in summer and I'll be a… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.84,0:48:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快乐的雪人！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ happy snowman! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.60,0:48:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使生活不容易 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When life gets rough ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.88,0:48:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我也会坚持自己的梦想 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I like to hold on to my dream. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.44,0:48:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 悠闲晒着夏日暖阳 烦恼全抛光 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Relaxing in the summer sun Just letting off steam. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.00,0:48:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 天空 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Oh, the sky ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.56,0:49:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是那么蓝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ will be blue. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.68,0:49:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你们也会和我在一起 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And you guys will be there, too. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.36,0:49:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我会像其他雪人一样 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When I finally do ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.68,0:49:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 好好享受 在夏天！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ what frozen things do in summer! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.92,0:49:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得告诉他 - 别那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I'm gonna tell him. - Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.04,0:49:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在夏天！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ In summer! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.24,0:49:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧！埃尔莎在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, come on! Elsa's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.56,0:49:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把夏天找回来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's go bring back summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.76,0:49:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Somebody's gotta tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.56,0:49:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你把树皮朝下放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no. You've got the bark facing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.04,0:49:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,树皮应该朝上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The bark needs to be face-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.80,0:49:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朝下更容易干 - 朝上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Bark down is drier. - Bark up!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.24,0:49:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朝下！- 爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Bark down! - Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.28,0:49:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,斗篷？有人需要斗篷吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cloak? Does anyone need a cloak?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.00,0:49:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔人民感激您 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle is indebted to you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.20,0:49:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,城堡开放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The castle is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.56,0:49:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,城堡的大厅会供应汤和热饮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There is soup and hot glogg in the great hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.80,0:49:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 发给大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here, pass these out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.92,0:49:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯王子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Prince Hans!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.48,0:49:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们只能坐在这里一边受冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are we expected to just sit here and freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.00,0:50:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边看着你把艾伦戴尔的出口物资都发给大家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}while you give away all of Arendelle's tradable goods?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.97,0:50:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是安娜公主的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Princess Anna has given her orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.40,0:50:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想说这事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And that's another thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.20,0:50:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不明白吗？你的公主有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Has it dawned on you that your princess may be conspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.80,0:50:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那个巫师迷惑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with a wicked Sorceress.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.12,0:50:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把我们都害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to destroy us all?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.20,0:50:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准你质疑公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do not question the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.08,0:50:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让我负责艾伦戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She left me in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.48,0:50:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是有人叛国\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I will not hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.80,0:50:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会毫不手软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to protect Arendelle from treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.64,0:50:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛国？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Treason?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.60,0:50:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.72,0:50:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa, boy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.84,0:50:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是安娜公主的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's Princess Anna's horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.20,0:50:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那公主在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, where is the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.12,0:50:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她会在哪里？- 她在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Where could she be? - Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.16,0:50:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜公主遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Princess Anna is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.32,0:50:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人愿意和我一起去找她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I need volunteers to go with me to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.16,0:50:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去 - 我也愿意去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I'll go. - I volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.40,0:50:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派两个人跟你去 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I volunteer two men, My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.96,0:50:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻提高警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Be prepared for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.64,0:50:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果遇到了女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And should you encounter the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.32,0:50:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就要让冬天结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you are to put an end to this winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.48,0:50:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Do you understand? - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.32,0:50:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么让这样的天气结束？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, how exactly are you planning to stop this weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.64,0:50:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我打算和我姐姐聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. I am gonna talk to my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.16,0:51:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.48,0:51:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的卖冰生意就指望你和你姐聊聊了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My ice business is riding on you talking to your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.36,0:51:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.24,0:51:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那看来你一点也不怕她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, you're not at all afraid of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.12,0:51:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为什么要怕她？- 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Why would I be? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.96,0:51:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜她肯定是最漂亮 最温柔的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I bet she's the nicest, gentlest, warmest person ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.16,0:51:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 快看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.80,0:51:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被刺穿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've been impaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.28,0:51:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.00,0:51:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.68,0:51:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,太陡峭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's too steep.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.80,0:51:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有一根绳子 而你又不会爬山\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've only got one rope and you don't know how to climb mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.32,0:51:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.68,0:51:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.36,0:51:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.68,0:51:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去见我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm going to see my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.88,0:51:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是不要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're gonna kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.52,0:51:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别踩那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wouldn't put my foot there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.84,0:51:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别让我分心 - 也别踩那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You're distracting me. - Or there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.72,0:51:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道埃尔莎愿意见你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How do you know Elsa even wants to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.64,0:51:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我不和你聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right. I'm just blocking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.40,0:51:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得专心爬山\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}because I gotta concentrate, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.44,0:51:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 躲在山里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, most people who disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.92,0:51:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是想要一个人静一静的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}into the mountains want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.68,0:51:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nobody wants to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.20,0:51:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许除了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Except maybe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.40,0:52:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不孤独 我有朋友的 好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm not alone. I have friends, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.40,0:52:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那些爱情专家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You mean, the love experts?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.52,0:52:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那些爱情专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, the love experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.96,0:52:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.32,0:52:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是快到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please tell me I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.20,0:52:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上边的空气是不是有点稀薄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Does the air seem a bit thin to you up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.04,0:52:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.12,0:52:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 斯文？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.40,0:52:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道能不能解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Not sure if this is gonna solve the problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.24,0:52:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我发现了一个楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but I found a staircase that leads exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.28,0:52:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好通往你们要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}where you wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.48,0:52:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！太好了 接住我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ha-ha! Thank goodness. Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.08,0:52:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 这是个信任大考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thanks. That was like a crazy trust exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.56,0:52:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.76,0:52:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是冰雪的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, that's ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.60,0:52:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I might cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.80,0:52:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭吧 我不会笑话你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go ahead. I won't judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.88,0:53:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别担心 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All right, take it easy, boy. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.76,0:53:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.92,0:53:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你留在这里吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. You stay right here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.12,0:53:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美无瑕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.52,0:53:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,敲门啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.60,0:53:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快敲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.00,0:53:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么不敲啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why isn't she knocking?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.52,0:53:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道她不会敲门吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you think she knows how to knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.80,0:53:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 门没锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Huh. It opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.96,0:53:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.84,0:53:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你们在这里等我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. You should probably wait out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.52,0:53:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 上一次我把男人介绍给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What? - The last time I introduced her to a guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.64,0:53:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把一切都冻住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}she froze everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.00,0:53:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 哦 别这样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But, but… oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.92,0:53:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是冰雪宫殿 我的毕生所爱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a palace made of ice. Ice is my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.96,0:53:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bye, Sven.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.00,0:53:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也等在这里 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You, too, Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.00,0:53:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？- 让我们单独谈一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Me? - Just give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.20,0:53:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.60,0:53:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}One, two,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.84,0:53:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三… - 四…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- three… - Four…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.00,0:54:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.28,0:54:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.32,0:54:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's me, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.32,0:54:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.48,0:54:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 埃尔莎 你变得不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa. Elsa, you look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.52,0:54:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,变漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a good different.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.44,0:54:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And this place…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.08,0:54:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.68,0:54:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.92,0:54:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都不了解自己的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I never knew what I was capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.72,0:54:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些事情太抱歉了 如果我知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm so sorry about what happened. If I'd have known…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.48,0:54:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no, no. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.84,0:54:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用道歉 但你最好还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't have to apologize, but you should probably go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.76,0:54:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.88,0:54:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才到这里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.76,0:54:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该在艾伦戴尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You belong down in Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.72,0:54:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.88,0:54:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 安娜 我应该在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, Anna, I belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.04,0:54:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.60,0:54:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就不会伤害到别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Where I can be who I am without hurting anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.96,0:54:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Actually, about that…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.52,0:55:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 六十！- 等一下 什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Sixty! - Wait. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！我叫雪宝 最喜欢暖暖的拥抱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi! I'm Olaf and I like warm hugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.12,0:55:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.08,0:55:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是你创造了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. You built me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.68,0:55:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.40,0:55:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活过来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.24,0:55:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… 我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Um… I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.96,0:55:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我们儿时堆的雪人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's just like the one we built as kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.72,0:55:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.44,0:55:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 以前我们那么要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa, we were so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.64,0:55:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后我们也可以那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We can be like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.76,0:55:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接住我！- 慢点儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Catch me! - Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.88,0:55:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.72,0:55:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.76,0:55:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能 再见了 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We can't. Goodbye, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.48,0:55:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.56,0:55:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来 我只是想保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I'm just trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.76,0:55:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必保护我 我不害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't have to protect me. I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.16,0:55:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别又不理我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please don't shut me out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.44,0:55:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请别关上门 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Please don't slam the door ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.52,0:55:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不必再保持距离 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You don't have to keep your distance anymore ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.60,0:55:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为第一次在生命里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause for the first time in forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.80,0:55:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我终于懂得 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I finally understand ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.80,0:56:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 第一次在生命里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ For the first time in forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.16,0:56:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们携手解决问题 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We can fix this hand in hand ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.44,0:56:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一起下山\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We can head down this mountain together.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.68,0:56:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不必活在恐惧中 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You don't have to live in fear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.64,0:56:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为第一次在生命里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause for the first time in forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.64,0:56:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我会陪着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I will be right here ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.92,0:56:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.20,0:56:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你快回家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Please go back home ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.12,0:56:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 过美好人生 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Your life awaits ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.76,0:56:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 享受阳光 享受自由 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Go enjoy the sun And open up the gates ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.24,0:56:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 但… - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yeah, but… - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.72,0:56:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是好意 但请离开 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You mean well But leave me be ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.12,0:56:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 我是一个人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Yes, I'm alone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.56,0:56:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我很自由 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I'm alone and free ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.52,0:56:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 离开我 你会更安全 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Just stay away And you'll be safe from me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.32,0:56:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 事实并非如此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Actually, we're not ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.57,0:56:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这话什么意思？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ What do you mean, you're not? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.76,0:56:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我想你好像不知道 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I get the feeling you don't know ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.32,0:56:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不知道什么？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ What do I not know? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 艾伦戴尔陷入了寒冷的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Arendelle's in deep, deep, deep ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.40,0:56:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 严冬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Deep snow ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.84,0:56:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.32,0:56:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎你把所有地方都变成了寒冬\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You kind of set off an eternal winter everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.20,0:57:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.36,0:57:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你可以让它们化冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, it's okay, you can just unfreeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.28,0:57:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I can't. I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.56,0:57:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sure you can. I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.20,0:57:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为第一次在生命里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause for the first time in forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.00,0:57:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 我真笨！不能随心所欲！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Oh, I'm such a fool! I can't be free! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.52,0:57:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不必害怕 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You don't have to be afraid ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.92,0:57:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 逃不开内心的风暴 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ No escape from the storm inside of me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.84,0:57:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们能携手渡难关 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We can work this out together ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.84,0:57:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我控制不了力量！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I can't control the curse! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.72,0:57:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们能停止这风暴 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We'll reverse the storm you've made ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.04,0:57:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 安娜别说了 只会更糟糕！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Anna, please you'll only make it worse! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.12,0:57:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 别害怕 ∮ - ∮ 我太害怕！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- ∮ Don't panic ∮ - ∮ There's so much fear! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.32,0:57:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们能让阳光普照 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We'll make the sun shine bright ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.92,0:57:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你在这里不安全！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You're not safe here! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.32,0:57:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们可以共同面对 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We can face this thing together ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.04,0:57:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ No! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.12,0:57:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们可以赶走寒冬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We can change this winter weather ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.28,0:57:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一切都会好起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And everything will be all right ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.32,0:57:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我做不到！∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I can't! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.24,0:57:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.84,0:57:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.28,0:57:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.48,0:57:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.00,0:58:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.16,0:58:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这不重要 就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, it doesn't matter. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.12,0:58:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.20,0:58:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我知道我们能解决这问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I know we can figure this out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.00,0:58:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么解决？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.08,0:58:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么力量赶走这寒冬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What power do you have to stop this winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.72,0:58:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}To stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.12,0:58:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 我想我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, I think we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.56,0:58:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不能留下你 埃尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I'm not leaving without you, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.56,0:58:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.08,0:58:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！放我们下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop! Put us down!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.80,0:58:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.00,0:58:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.16,0:58:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我的屁股！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Watch out for my butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.12,0:58:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把人丢来丢去真不礼貌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It is not nice to throw people!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.96,0:58:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 别激动 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa, whoa, whoa, feisty-pants. Okay, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.20,0:58:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静！冷静一些！- 好！好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Just calm down! Calm down! - Okay! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.60,0:58:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 别去惹大雪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I'm okay. - Just let the snowman be.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.28,0:58:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很冷静 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I'm calm. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.60,0:58:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.37,0:58:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧？你把它惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Look, see? Now, you made him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.84,0:58:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来引开他 你们快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll distract him. You guys go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.80,0:58:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！没说你们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no! Not you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.80,0:59:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这样根本跑不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This just got a whole lot harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.12,0:59:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.88,0:59:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.72,0:59:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.08,0:59:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中他了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.64,0:59:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.16,0:59:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有一百英尺高\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a 100-foot drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.76,0:59:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是两百\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.16,0:59:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.00,0:59:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要干嘛？- 我要挖一个雪锚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What's that for? - I'm digging a snow anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.20,0:59:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要是掉下去了怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. What if we fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.32,0:59:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有20英尺厚的积雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There's 20 feet of fresh powder down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.12,0:59:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉下去也就是像掉在枕头上一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It'll be like landing on a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.88,0:59:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hopefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.32,0:59:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 安娜 我数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, Anna. On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.20,0:59:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Okay. - One…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.56,0:59:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我什么时候跳 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You tell me when. I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.64,0:59:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二… - 我都准备好了！好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Two… - I was born ready! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.28,0:59:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.40,0:59:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,树！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.68,0:59:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎… 哇哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What the… Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.72,1:00:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.72,1:00:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我都走形了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Man, am I out of shape.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.64,1:00:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 嘿 安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There we go. Hey, Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.52,1:00:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文！你们在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven! Where did you guys go?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.36,1:00:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全甩掉那个大棉花糖啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We totally lost Marshmallow back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.48,1:00:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！我们正说你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey! We were just talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.04,1:00:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好 一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All good things, all good things.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.52,1:00:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.28,1:00:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也没什么区别啦 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is not making much of a difference, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.72,1:00:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.80,1:00:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 伙计们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang in there, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.84,1:00:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 再快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go. Go faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.96,1:00:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 什么？- 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Wait, what? - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.04,1:00:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.60,1:00:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.56,1:00:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.24,1:00:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.28,1:01:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你说得对 就像摔在枕头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, you were right. Just like a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.56,1:01:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.32,1:01:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没知觉了！我的腿没知觉了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't feel my legs! I can't feel my legs!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.68,1:01:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我的腿 - 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Those are my legs. - Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.56,1:01:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 帮我个忙 抓住我的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, do me a favor, grab my butt.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.08,1:01:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这下好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. That feels better.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.40,1:01:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 斯文！他找到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Sven! He found us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.24,1:01:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是我的亲亲小驯鹿啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who's my cute little reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.16,1:01:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟他用那种口气说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't talk to him like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.28,1:01:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挠我痒痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're tickling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.00,1:01:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.52,1:01:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.60,1:01:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.80,1:01:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.20,1:01:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的头怎么样了？- 啊！哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- How's your head? - Ah! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.12,1:01:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's fine. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.44,1:01:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我没事 我头盖骨厚着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh, I'm good. I've got a thick skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.12,1:01:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有头盖骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't have a skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.72,1:01:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Or bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.12,1:01:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 呃… 现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, uh… So, now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.96,1:01:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.80,1:01:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.20,1:01:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.60,1:01:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.44,1:01:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我扔出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She threw me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.84,1:01:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样子的天气我还不能回艾伦戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't go back to Arendelle with the weather like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.20,1:01:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的卖冰生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And then there's your ice business.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.28,1:01:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 别担心我的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, hey. Don't worry about my ice business.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.92,1:02:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先担心一下你的头发！- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Worry about your hair! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.76,1:02:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚从悬崖上掉下来 你应该看看你的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just fell off a cliff. You should see your hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.64,1:02:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 你的头发变白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, yours is turning white.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.36,1:02:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,白了？这… 是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}White? It's… What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.28,1:02:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她打中了你 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's because she struck you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.84,1:02:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很丑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Does it look bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会 - 你犹豫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No. - You hesitated.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.04,1:02:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.44,1:02:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 你需要帮助 知道吗？过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, you need help, okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.56,1:02:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！我们要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay! Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.32,1:02:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去见我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}To see my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.36,1:02:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群爱情专家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The love experts?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.68,1:02:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱情专家？- 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Love experts? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.80,1:02:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 他们会搞定这事儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And don't worry, they'll be able to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.16,1:02:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.68,1:02:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我以前看他们做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because I've seen them do it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.76,1:02:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己也是个爱情专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I like to consider myself a love expert.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.72,1:02:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,打起精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.00,1:02:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Control it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.56,1:02:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去想 别去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't feel. Don't feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.72,1:02:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.52,1:02:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去想！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't feel!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.84,1:03:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 斯文 天空都醒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, Sven, the sky is awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.48,1:03:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你冷吗？- 有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Are you cold? - A little.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.04,1:03:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 等等 过来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh… Wait. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.96,1:03:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.64,1:03:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.44,1:03:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到我的朋友们 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, uh, about my friends. Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.92,1:03:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然说是「朋友」…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I say "friends"…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.36,1:03:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们更像是一个大家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}they're more like family.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.40,1:03:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候 只有斯文陪着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anyway, when I was a kid, it was just me and Sven.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.40,1:03:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到那群家伙接纳了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Until they, you know, kinda took us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.80,1:03:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们接纳了你？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- They did? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.56,1:03:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吓到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't want to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.68,1:03:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能有一点不太一样 还有点吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They can be a little inappropriate and loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.12,1:03:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是很吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Very loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.72,1:03:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候他们还很顽固\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They are also stubborn at times,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.68,1:03:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有点傲慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and a little overbearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.96,1:03:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且有点重 是非常 非常重\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And heavy. Really, really, heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.76,1:03:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你会感觉到的 他们都很善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But you'll get it. They mean well.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.12,1:03:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫 他们听起来很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff, they sound wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.36,1:03:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.56,1:03:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来见见我的家人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Meet my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.20,1:03:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.76,1:04:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些都是石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.52,1:04:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越来越靓了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You are a sight for sore eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.80,1:04:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.16,1:04:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛克还是老样子 这么有棱角\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Rocko's looking sharp, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.56,1:04:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷 哇哦… 我都快认不出来你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Clay, whoa… I don't even recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.92,1:04:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瘦了很多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You lost so much weight.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.04,1:04:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快点跑 我引开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll distract him while you run.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.00,1:04:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 斯文的家人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi, Sven's family!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.20,1:04:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你们真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.96,1:04:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱你 安娜 我一定要让你溜掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because I love you, Anna, I insist you run.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.44,1:04:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们都是爱情专家 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I understand you're love experts. Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.80,1:04:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还不快跑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why aren't you running?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.60,1:04:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.80,1:04:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. Well, I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.48,1:04:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 不 不 不 安娜 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Go. - No, no, no. Anna, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.72,1:04:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.56,1:04:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.76,1:04:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.00,1:04:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫回家了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff's home!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.72,1:04:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克里斯多夫在这儿！- 克里斯多夫回来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Kristoff's here! - Kristoff's home!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.84,1:04:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 「克里斯多夫」？- 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Wait, "Kristoff"? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.32,1:04:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 快让我看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ah, let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.80,1:04:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你衣服脱了 我帮你洗洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take off your clothes, I wash them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.48,1:04:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不用 我要穿着我的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No! No, I'm going to keep my clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.40,1:04:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look, it's great to see you all,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.80,1:04:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是外公呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but where's Granpabbie?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.04,1:05:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在打瞌睡呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's napping.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.16,1:05:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看你看 我长蘑菇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But look, I grew a mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.96,1:05:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我… - 我有火焰水晶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I… - I earned my fire crystal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.56,1:05:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我取了块肾结石\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I passed a kidney stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.04,1:05:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫 抱抱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff, pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.32,1:05:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越长越大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're getting big.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.60,1:05:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.32,1:05:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,石精 他们是石精！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Trolls. They're trolls!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.24,1:05:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带了个女孩儿回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's brought a girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.48,1:05:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.08,1:05:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦！- 这真是个姑娘吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Whoa! - Is that a real girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.76,1:05:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就像个小杯糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's like a little cupcake.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.96,1:05:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经学会怎么跟着他们疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've learned to just roll with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.32,1:05:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来看看 明亮的眼睛 挺翘的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me see. Bright eyes, working nose,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.88,1:05:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,强健的牙齿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}strong teeth!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.48,1:05:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了 她真的很配我们的克里斯多夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes, yes. She'll do nicely for our Kristoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.28,1:05:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, wait, wait. Oh, um, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.52,1:05:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 你们想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No. - You've got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.92,1:05:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是因为这个把她带来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. That's not why I brought her here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.08,1:05:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们不是… 我不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Right. We're not… I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.96,1:05:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗 亲爱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's the issue, dear?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.16,1:05:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要拒绝这么好的男人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why are you holding back from such a man?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.32,1:05:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为他走路笨笨的？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Is it the clumpy way he walks? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.36,1:05:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- ∮ 还是因为他讲话太暴躁？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What? - ∮ Or the grumpy way he talks? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.68,1:05:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 不 - ∮ 还是因为他又圆又方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh, no. - ∮ Or the pear-shaped, square-shaped ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.48,1:05:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 离奇的大脚？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Weirdness of his feet? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.04,1:05:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.16,1:05:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 尽管我们知道他洗好了澡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And though we know he washes well ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.12,1:05:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但是闻起来还是有点糟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ He always ends up sort of smelly ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.76,1:05:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但你再也找不到像他这样 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But you'll never meet a fella ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.40,1:06:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 甜蜜又细心的家伙 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who's as sensitive and sweet ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.36,1:06:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的很不错 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's nice, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.48,1:06:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他还亟需一点修缮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So, he's a bit of a fixer-upper ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.52,1:06:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 哇哦 哇哦… - ∮ 他还有很多缺点 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Whoa, whoa, whoa… - ∮ So, he's got a few flaws ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.60,1:06:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 比如他奇怪的头脑 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like his peculiar brain, dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.84,1:06:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 还有他可爱的驯鹿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ His thing with the reindeer ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.00,1:06:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这都有些超出自然法则 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ That's a little outside of nature's laws ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.68,1:06:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题不是我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is not about me!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.80,1:06:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他还亟需一点修缮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So, he's a bit of a fixer-upper ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.56,1:06:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但是我们坚信 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But this we're certain of ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.76,1:06:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你能用一点爱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You can fix this fixer-upper up ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.40,1:06:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 完善这个亟需修缮的家伙 ∮ - 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- ∮ With a little bit of love ∮ - Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.20,1:06:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能不说这个了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Can we please just stop talking about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.24,1:06:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在真的有很严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We've got a real, actual problem, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.48,1:06:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你解答 告诉我 亲爱的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll say. So, tell me, dear…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.40,1:06:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为他害怕得逃跑？∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Is it the way that he runs scared? ∮
