Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.60,1:11:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.76,1:11:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他的胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Grab his arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.24,1:11:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Aim…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.01,1:11:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This way, this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.24,1:11:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.60,1:11:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎女王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.32,1:11:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要变成让大家惧怕的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't be the monster they fear you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.52,1:12:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 我到底… 我到底做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no. What have… What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.88,1:12:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么带我来这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.76,1:12:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让他们把你杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I couldn't just let them kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.44,1:12:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会害了艾伦戴尔这座城的 去救安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I'm a danger to Arendelle. Get Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.12,1:13:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜还没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna has not returned.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.80,1:13:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就结束这个寒冬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If you would just stop the winter.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.20,1:13:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让夏天回来 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bring back summer, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.92,1:13:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.68,1:13:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他们放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You have to tell them to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.88,1:13:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会竭尽全力去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I will do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.68,1:13:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.00,1:13:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 再快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, buddy, faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.20,1:13:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.36,1:13:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！我会和你们在城堡里会合！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa! I'll meet you guys at the castle!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.61,1:13:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别被人发现了 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stay out of sight, Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.00,1:14:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I will!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.56,1:14:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨！- 它是活的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hello! - It's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.16,1:14:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安娜公主！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's Princess Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.88,1:14:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.88,1:14:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.68,1:14:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.52,1:14:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都担心死了 - 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You had us worried sick. - My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.44,1:14:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给她取暖 快找汉斯王子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get her warm. And find Prince Hans, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.44,1:14:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We will. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.12,1:14:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请确保她的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Make sure she's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.01,1:14:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 可怜的孩子 看你冻得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, you poor girl, you're freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.68,1:14:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在赶紧进屋 暖和暖和\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, let's get you inside now and get you warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.48,1:14:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去找安娜公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm going back out to look for Princess Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.40,1:15:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再冒风险回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You cannot risk going out there again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.41,1:15:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她出事了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If anything happens to her…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.60,1:15:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果公主遭遇不测\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If anything happens to the princess,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.72,1:15:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能丢下整个艾伦戴尔不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you are all Arendelle has left.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.72,1:15:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He's in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.52,1:15:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Prince Hans.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.64,1:15:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.08,1:15:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你浑身冰凉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're so cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.20,1:15:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汉斯 你快亲我 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Hans, you have to kiss me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.44,1:15:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在！就现在！- 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Now! Now! - Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.16,1:15:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让你们单独待一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We'll give you two some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.76,1:15:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面都怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.04,1:15:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎用魔法击中了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa struck me with her powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.16,1:15:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过她不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You said she would never hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.68,1:15:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.76,1:15:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.92,1:15:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她施魔法冰封了我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She froze my heart,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.72,1:15:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在唯一的解救办法就是真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and only an act of true love can save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.92,1:15:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真爱之吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A true love's kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.72,1:15:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.48,1:15:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这里有爱你的人就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If only there was someone out there who loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.56,1:15:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.48,1:16:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You said you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.44,1:16:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家的王室中我排名十三\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}As thirteenth in line in my own kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.20,1:16:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本没有机会继承\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.48,1:16:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白我必须与其他王室结姻才有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I knew I would have to marry into the throne somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.24,1:16:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你都在说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What… what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.28,1:16:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为继承人 埃尔莎当然是最合适的人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}As heir, Elsa was preferable, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.00,1:16:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可惜她不愿接触任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But no one was getting anywhere with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.84,1:16:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你… - 汉斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- But you… - Hans!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.92,1:16:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么渴望爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You were so desperate for love,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.44,1:16:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还那么快要和我结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you were willing to marry me just like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.80,1:16:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到我们在一起后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I figured after we married,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.64,1:16:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得对埃尔莎制造点小意外就更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I would have to stage a little accident for Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.80,1:16:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯！不 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hans! No. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.12,1:16:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她命中注定如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But then, she doomed herself,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.16,1:16:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还傻兮兮地去追她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and you were dumb enough to go after her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.12,1:16:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.24,1:16:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就剩下把埃尔莎杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}All that's left now is to kill Elsa,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.44,1:16:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让夏天回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and bring back summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.40,1:16:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是埃尔莎的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're no match for Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.44,1:16:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才不是埃尔莎的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, you're no match for Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.48,1:16:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.24,1:16:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是那个拯救艾伦戴尔于危难中的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}am the hero who is going to save Arendelle from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.40,1:16:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.36,1:16:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.20,1:16:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经胜券在握\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.44,1:17:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please, somebody, help.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.08,1:17:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.04,1:17:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气越来越冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's getting colder by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.00,1:17:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们再不抓紧 我们就全都被冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If we don't do something soon, we'll all freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.72,1:17:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Prince Hans.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.40,1:17:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜公主…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Princess Anna is…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.12,1:17:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.24,1:17:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.32,1:17:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.68,1:17:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是被杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She was killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.72,1:17:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是埃尔莎女王干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}By Queen Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.08,1:17:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.48,1:17:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是她的亲妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Her own sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.48,1:17:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少她说完了结婚誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}At least we got to say our marriage vows.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.00,1:17:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,才死在了我怀里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}before she died in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.96,1:17:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在毋庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There can be no doubt now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.96,1:17:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎女王就是个魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen Elsa is a monster,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.40,1:17:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们都陷入了一场严重的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and we are all in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.56,1:17:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Prince Hans,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.44,1:17:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔人民全指望您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle looks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.96,1:17:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着沉重的心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}With a heavy heart,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.72,1:18:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宣布艾伦戴尔女王埃尔莎犯了叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I charge Queen Elsa of Arendelle with treason.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.72,1:18:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,并判以死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And sentence her to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.12,1:18:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.56,1:18:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.64,1:18:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再快点 - 当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Move quickly. - Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.56,1:18:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 门打不开！- 是被冻上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- It won't open! - It's frozen shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.28,1:18:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快撞进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Put your back into it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.72,1:18:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力！撞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on! Push!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.48,1:18:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is it, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.56,1:18:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.56,1:18:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.00,1:19:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂你这么跟我说话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't understand you when you talk like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.64,1:19:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来！放我下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop it! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.32,1:19:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 斯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, Sven!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.64,1:19:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We're not going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.24,1:19:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经跟她的心上人在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's with her true love.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.72,1:19:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.64,1:19:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.96,1:19:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快 斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on! Come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.68,1:19:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Help.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.88,1:20:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.24,1:20:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.72,1:20:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.28,1:20:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝 快离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf. Get away from there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.88,1:20:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.52,1:20:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是火\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, this is heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.92,1:20:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.44,1:20:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！但别碰火\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ooh! But don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.32,1:20:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯呢？你的真爱之吻不管用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, where's Hans? What happened to your kiss?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.76,1:20:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我错看他了 我们之间不是真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was wrong about him. It wasn't true love.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.08,1:20:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们特地赶回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But we ran all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.76,1:20:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的 雪宝 快离开这里 你会融化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please, Olaf, you can't stay here. You'll melt.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.24,1:20:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am not leaving here until.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.36,1:20:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非能找到真爱的力量救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}we find some other act of true love to save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.36,1:20:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么好点子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you happen to have any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.56,1:20:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道什么叫做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't even know what love is.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.60,1:20:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's okay, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.72,1:20:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Love is.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.08,1:21:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把别人看得比自己重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}putting someone else's needs before yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.12,1:21:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像克里斯多夫把你送回到汉斯身边 然后永远离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like, you know, how Kristoff brought you back here to Hans and left you forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.28,1:21:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫爱我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff loves me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.88,1:21:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你真是对爱一窍不通 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wow, you really don't know anything about love, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.12,1:21:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝 你在融化\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf, you're melting.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.04,1:21:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人真的值得为之融化\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Some people are worth melting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.44,1:21:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不应该是这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just maybe not right this second.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.80,1:21:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌 我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't worry, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.80,1:21:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会撑过去… 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We're gonna get through… Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.00,1:21:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我好像看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on, I'm getting something.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.60,1:21:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克里斯多夫和斯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's Kristoff and Sven!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.16,1:21:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正往回赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're coming back this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.00,1:21:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的… 是他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They… They are?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.48,1:21:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！他跑得真快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wow! He's really moving fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.28,1:21:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.64,1:21:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想克里斯多夫太爱你了 他不会把你丢下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I guess Kristoff doesn't love you enough to leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.84,1:21:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快扶我起来 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Help me up, Olaf. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.84,1:21:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别！你要待在火炉边上取暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no, no! You need to stay by the fire and keep warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.00,1:22:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去找克里斯多夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I need to get to Kristoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.76,1:22:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.16,1:22:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我明白了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, I know why!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.96,1:22:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你的真爱力量！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There's your act of true love right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.16,1:22:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跨越海湾的那个劲头 活脱脱一个勇敢但有汗臭味的驯鹿国王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Riding across the fjords like a valiant, pungent reindeer king!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.16,1:22:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.92,1:22:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.52,1:22:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.68,1:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 往回走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh… Back this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.56,1:22:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.44,1:22:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.72,1:22:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.44,1:22:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这滑下去 安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Slide, Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.96,1:23:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.56,1:23:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.88,1:23:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 哥们 再快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, buddy, faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.80,1:23:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.08,1:23:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.92,1:23:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.92,1:23:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.32,1:24:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.64,1:24:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.20,1:24:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.24,1:24:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文… 斯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven… Sven!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.32,1:24:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.24,1:24:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.68,1:24:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克里斯多夫… - 安娜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Kristoff… - Anna…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.32,1:25:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.96,1:25:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎！别再逃避了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa! You can't run from this!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.60,1:25:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好照顾我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just take care of my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.64,1:25:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.28,1:25:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从山上回来的时候又虚又冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She returned from the mountain weak and cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.12,1:25:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你冰封了她的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She said that you froze her heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.24,1:25:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.40,1:25:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想救她 可都来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I tried to save her, but it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.84,1:25:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她冷得像块冰 头发全白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Her skin was ice. Her hair turned white.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.80,1:25:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your sister is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.20,1:25:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.00,1:25:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.32,1:25:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯多夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.76,1:25:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.84,1:26:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.56,1:26:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.12,1:26:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.00,1:26:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.52,1:26:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.88,1:26:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.92,1:26:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.44,1:27:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.44,1:27:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 埃尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.92,1:27:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为救我牺牲了你自己？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You sacrificed yourself for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.96,1:27:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.52,1:27:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「真爱的力量可以融化冰冻的心」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"An act of true love will thaw a frozen heart."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.84,1:27:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「爱能融化一切」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Love will thaw."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.88,1:27:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是爱 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Love. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.44,1:27:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.16,1:28:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用爱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Love!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.08,1:28:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.92,1:28:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一生中最美好的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hands down, this is the best day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.80,1:28:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很可能是最后的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And, quite possibly, the last.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.76,1:28:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝！坚持住 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Olaf! Hang on, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.56,1:28:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.16,1:29:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小云朵！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My own personal flurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.92,1:29:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别… 别… 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Uh… uh… uh… uh.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.64,1:29:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.96,1:29:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她冰封了你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But she froze your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.92,1:29:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这里心被冻上的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The only frozen heart around here is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.76,1:29:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.64,1:29:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定航路 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Setting course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.28,1:29:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把这家伙送回他的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I will return this scoundrel to his country.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.84,1:29:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就看看他那十二个哥哥怎么处理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We shall see what his 12 big brothers think of his behavior.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.88,1:29:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔感谢您 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle thanks you, milord.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.48,1:29:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.32,1:29:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个可怜的受害者 我精神上受了打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am a victim of fear. I've been traumatized.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.48,1:29:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！我的脖子扭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ah! My neck hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.64,1:30:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上有看病的医生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is there a doctor that I could see?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.04,1:30:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求见女王！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I demand to see the queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.44,1:30:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王下达了命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. I have a message from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.08,1:30:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「艾伦戴尔从今日起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Arendelle will henceforth and forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.92,1:30:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,将不与黄鼠狼镇进行任何邦交「\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}no longer do business of any sort with Weaseltown."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.08,1:30:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「威尔镇」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Weselton."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.24,1:30:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是威尔镇！- 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- It's Weselton! - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.80,1:30:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.00,1:30:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我在走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, okay, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.40,1:30:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杆子！啊！- 对不起啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Pole! Whoops! - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.68,1:30:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.24,1:30:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了 哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here we are. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.24,1:30:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你个雪橇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I owe you a sled.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.32,1:30:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认真的吗？- 对啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Are you serious? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.36,1:30:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是最新的款式\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And it's the latest model.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.00,1:30:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我不能要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, I can't accept this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.60,1:30:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要 不能退 不能换 女王的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You have to. No returns. No exchanges. Queen's orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.68,1:30:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她封你为艾伦戴尔法定运冰官\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's named you the Official Arendelle Ice Master and Deliverer.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.64,1:30:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？就没听过这个名字 - 有这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- What? That's not a thing. - Oh, sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.52,1:30:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面还有个杯架 你喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And it even has a cup holder. Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.04,1:30:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢？简直太爱了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like it? I love it!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.36,1:30:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.44,1:30:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想亲你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I could kiss you!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.00,1:30:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以 我是说 我希望 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I could. I mean, I'd like to. I'd…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.88,1:31:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能吗？我是说 我们可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}May I? We me. I mean, may we?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.08,1:31:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.16,1:31:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We may.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.80,1:31:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.44,1:31:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Summer!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.44,1:31:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ooh…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.80,1:31:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.16,1:31:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.92,1:31:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冰！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ice!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.80,1:31:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！哇哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ooh! Whoo-hoo…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.48,1:31:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,旋转着滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Swing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.92,1:31:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ooh…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.00,1:31:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢开放城堡大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I like the open gates.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.76,1:32:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会再关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We are never closing them again.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.64,1:32:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃尔莎 这冰鞋是好看 可我不会滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Elsa, they're beautiful, but you know I don't skate.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.20,1:32:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！你可以的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.96,1:32:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 驯鹿过来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look out. Reindeer coming through.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.36,1:32:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住了 我抓住了 我不行了 不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I got it, I got it. I don't got it, I don't got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.12,1:32:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 小伙伴们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.20,1:32:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it, Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.52,1:32:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑起来 转圈圈 滑起来 转圈圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Glide and pivot. And glide and pivot.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.84,1:32:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.20,1:41:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh!
